00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:25.050
<b>If I had headed straight to the capital,
I could've turned this around.</b>

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:27.550
<b>Holed up in the castle, bought some time,</b>

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.560
<b>prepared my troops, and devised some tactics...</b>

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.980
<b>But there's no point in regretting a missed chance.</b>

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:39.570
<b>Why did you...</b>

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.030
<b>Why did you attack Alsace?</b>

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.780
<b>With Alsace under my control,
I could've prevented Zhctedian interference.</b>

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:53.830
<b>Torching the land and driving its people out would've made it a sure deal.</b>

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.330
<b>That's the reason you attacked?</b>

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:56.710
<b>That's the reason.</b>

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.840
<b>The simple truth remains that you brought the Zhctedian army here.</b>

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:06.010
<b>And if you hadn't, that miserable Ganelon would've done so.</b>

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:09.140
<b>That man has past ties to Zhcted, after all.</b>

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.430
<b>Then again, so do I.</b>

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:22.480
<b>I really can't forgive you.</b>

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:30.160
<b>Nor can I forgive you for slaying my son.</b>

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:52.810
<b><i>You have mastered my power.</i></b>

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:56.730
<b><i>If you desire, that power could...</i></b>

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:07.110
<b>More power...</b>

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:07.820
<b>Hey.</b>

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.170
<b>Getting vengeance isn't wrong.</b>

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.420
<b>But don't get lost in your hatred.</b>

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.140
<b>Don't rely on it as a weapon.</b>

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.070
<b>Boy!</b>

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.740
<b>Boy!</b>

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.920
<b>Avenging his son, huh?</b>

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:06.880
<b>I'll be right back.</b>

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:38.080
<b>You're facing me with a single arrow?</b>

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.860
<b>I won't need a second one.</b>

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.130
<b>In fact, it would weaken my resolve.</b>

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.130
<b>Very well.</b>

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.280
<b><i>Goddess of wind and storms...</i></b>

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.250
<b>Lost your nerve?!</b>

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.040
<b>Vorn!</b>

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:51.530
<b>But how...?</b>

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.250
<b>The... wind...</b>

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:14.470
<b>Brune...</b>

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.770
<b>Did you cause that gust of wind?</b>

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.730
<b>Oh? You didn't?</b>

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:36.200
<b>Tigre won on his own.</b>

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:39.450
<b>He made the wind his ally.</b>

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:44.200
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:53.260
<b>Tigre joined the war at Dinant.
And this is how he ended it.</b>

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:01.720
<b>The bow has been left in your charge.</b>

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.730
<b>Go ahead and bolster your power as much as you can.</b>

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:09.440
<b>We'll be departing momentarily, Duke Ganelon.</b>

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:13.480
<b>Oh, long time no see,</b>

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:16.400
<b>Lady Valentina Glinka Estes.</b>

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.990
<b>I'm in your debt.</b>

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.990
<b>Glad to be of service.</b>

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.410
<b>Come to think of it, today is
his triumphant homecoming, right?</b>

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:29.170
<b>Count Tigrevurmud Vorn's, that is.</b>

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:37.760
<b>It's too loud!</b>

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.720
<b>Long live Brune!</b>

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.260
<b>Long live Count Vorn!</b>

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.520
<b>Count Vorn!</b>

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.310
<b>Long live the princess!</b>

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:02.990
<b>Those clothes suit you well, Sir Tigrevurmud.</b>

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.160
<b>Y-Yes, I'm fine!</b>

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.670
<b>Er, I uh...</b>

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.290
<b>Most handsome.</b>

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:15.050
<b>Oh, I mean...</b>

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:19.340
<b>wearing clothes I'm not used to
makes me... how should say this?</b>

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:25.310
<b>Under normal circumstances
I'd be the one sitting next to Tigre.</b>

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:27.060
<b>Yeah, same here.</b>

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:28.680
<b>Whatever.</b>

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.270
<b>After this, Tigre is coming to Leitmeritz.</b>

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:32.230
<b>Ah, yes.</b>

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.940
<b>Tigre will be coming to—<i>Zhcted</i>.</b>

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.190
<b>You can't leave good enough alone, can you?!</b>

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.570
<b>What about <i>you</i>?!</b>

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.060
<b>In here.</b>

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:15.810
<b>An envoy from Zhcted is already waiting.</b>

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.730
<b>Come...</b>

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:22.990
<b>Sofy!</b>

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:24.820
<b>Elen.</b>

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:33.250
<b>I heard the particulars from Badouin.</b>

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.920
<b>I'm sorry, Regin.</b>

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:42.470
<b>It's my fault for failing both to be a wise father and a wise king.</b>

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.930
<b>No... No...</b>

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:49.470
<b>Taking care of this should've been my responsibility,</b>

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:52.480
<b>but I forced it entirely onto your shoulders.</b>

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:55.980
<b>Count Vorn, how can I reward you?</b>

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:01.610
<b>I have a few requests.</b>

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.530
