00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:21.300
<b>Her signature on these provisions makes it known</b>

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:27.510
<b>to the Kingdom of Zhcted that Princess Regin 
is going to be Brune's next ruler.</b>

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:32.180
<b>Count Vorn...</b>

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.060
<b>Sire!</b>

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:37.350
<b>There's another thing I would like to
grant you in appreciation of your deeds.</b>

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:43.070
<b>I hereby bestow upon you the title of 
Lumiere, Knight of Moonlight.</b>

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:45.950
<b>Th-Thank you very much.</b>

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:48.570
<b>First meteors, and now moonlight!</b>

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:50.120
<b>Congratulations, Sir Tigrevurmud!</b>

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.120
<b>Isn't that classy!</b>

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.120
<b>Congratulations.</b>

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.330
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.740
<b>Long live the Knight of Moonlight!</b>

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.370
<b>Come on, show a little cheer!</b>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:55.960
<b>Hey, we're in His Majesty's presence!</b>

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:03.460
<b>Several days later, King Faron quietly takes his last breath.</b>

