00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:24.730
<b>Where's Sir Tigrevurmud?</b>

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:27.740
<b>Hunting. It's spring, after all.</b>

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:28.740
<b>Ah, hey!</b>

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:31.320
<b>How are the Vosges 
Mountain Highway repairs going?</b>

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:40.330
fui no kurai kizashi furiharau you ni

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:40.330
As if to shake off this sense of foreboding,

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:34.910
<b>Engineers from Brune have arrived and are making preparations now.</b>

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:37.080
<b>As soon as the ice thaws, they'll start operations.</b>

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:41.630
<b>So Regin is keeping her promise to the letter. Good, good.</b>

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:50.220
yubisaki e to minagiru chikara wo shinarase nagara

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:50.220
I direct the power that flows from my fingertips

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:45.840
<b>Lady Eleonora, Alsace may be under
your and Princess Regin's joint control,</b>

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:48.260
<b>but ultimately that wasn't a treaty between two countries.</b>

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.340
<b>It's only a promise exchanged between a princess and a principality, so...</b>

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:58.060
ano mato wo nerai ko wo egake

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:58.060
fly like an arrow at the target in sight.

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:52.890
<b>I know.</b>

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:56.220
<b>It relies on her goodwill alone.</b>

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:01.860
kagirinaku yuke yo

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:01.860
Keep pushing on.

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:00.980
<b><i>Everyone is keeping an eye on you.</i></b>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:06.070
tada tachimukaeba ii

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:06.070
Just face everything head on.

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:10.360
kachime naku tomo kutsugaeseru sa

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:10.360
It's always possible to beat the odds.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.660
kono ya wa hazusanai

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.660
My arrows will never miss.

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:20.920
takameru kaze yo kuroki yumi yo

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:20.920
Fierce winds, guide my black bow

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:17.620
<b><i>So what is it you have in your sights?</i></b>

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:23.210
<b><i>Knight of Moonlight—</i></b>

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:28.890
unmei sae mo ute

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:28.890
as I shoot through fate.

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.920
<b><i>Everyone who received that title
ended up becoming King of Brune.</i></b>

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:28.920
